  <Docs>
    <typeparam name="T">The type of elements in the enumerable.</typeparam>
    <summary>
            A synchronous enumerable wrapper for <see cref="T:System.Collections.Generic.IAsyncEnumerable`1" /> that allows async enumerables
            to be used in synchronous foreach loops. Both <see cref="T:Microsoft.ClientModel.TestFramework.TaskExtensions.Enumerable`1" /> and <see cref="T:Microsoft.ClientModel.TestFramework.TaskExtensions.Enumerator`1" />
            are defined as public structs so that foreach can use duck typing to call
            <see cref="M:Microsoft.ClientModel.TestFramework.TaskExtensions.Enumerable`1.GetEnumerator" /> and avoid heap memory allocation.
            </summary>
    <remarks>To be added.</remarks>
